Upstream base: spark-ds41f-1126 vLLM d8784b841c360f523ec20e44bf8fb0898f36d3e4.

Preserve a literal EOS spelling in multibyte JSON while still removing actual stop IDs. Keep the 1126 serving parser and cover its registered adapters and scanner.

Upstream status: downstream integration.
